# Full-detail documents.
#
# These carry the student's and the guide's contact details, which IGNOU needs
# on the proforma and the certificate but which have no business on a public,
# search-indexed page. Only the *_PUBLIC builds are committed. Rebuild these
# locally when you need to print:  python3 build_print.py
